<title>UK: Metro Finance sets 100 mln Polish zloty 3-yr bond. [CORRECTED 09:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Metro Finance sets 100 mln Polish zloty 3-yr bond. [CORRECTED 09:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   METRO FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  METRO AG</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN PLZ   COUPON    *18.50 PCT MATURITY    22.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.25   PAY DATE    22.MAY.97</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects ISS PRICE to 100.25 from 100.125)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	=</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects FULL FEES to 1.50 from 1.375)</p>
<p> NOTES    ALL PAYMENTS WILL BE MADE IN DEM AT THE THEN</p>
<p>	    PREVAILING ZLOTY/DEM EXCHANGE RATE</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-20-200  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p> US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.75	  SELL CONC   0.75</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects MGT/UND to 0.75 from 0.625)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
